|1220|Arable Crops|Dry pulses & Vegetables|Dry pulses|
|1310|Arable Crops|Root/tuber crops|Potatoes|
|1320|Arable Crops|Root/tuber crops|Sugar Beet|
|1410|Arable Crops|Non-permanent industrial crops|Sunflower|
|1420|Arable Crops|Non-permanent industrial crops|Soybeans|
|1430|Arable Crops|Non-permanent industrial crops|Rapeseed|
